  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Providing Refugee Resettlement Assistance to the Government of Germany (Resettlement to Germany) 04/2024- 03/2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project provides comprehensive resettlement support to beneficiaries of international protection identified by the Government of Germany for resettlement to Germany from Egypt, Jordan, Kenya, Lebanon, Pakistan, Rwanda and other third countries. Under this project, IOM is supporting the German Federal Office for Migration and Refugees (BAMF) in the selection mission, facilitating visa/travel document processing, providing pre-departure health assessments and pre-embarkation checks to establish fitness to travel, holding pre-departure orientation trainings, and providing movement management and operational assistance to ensure that all beneficiaries travel to their final destination safely.</narrative>
  </description>
